# Storefront (load with `frontend/Storefront/`)

Local: `http://localhost:3000` — `frontend/LOCAL_STACK_ACCESS.md:9`. API: `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL` — `frontend/Storefront/src/config/env.ts:11`.

## Canonical routes (ADR-010 / RFC-004 / RFC-005)

| Surface | Path | As-built |
|---------|------|----------|
| PDP | `/product/{slug}` | `src/app/product/[slug]/page.tsx` |
| id → slug 301 | `/product/{id}` | same file `:69-75` (`permanentRedirect`) |
| Brand hub | `/brands/{slug}` | `src/app/brands/[slug]/page.tsx` + `docs/architecture/information-architecture/brand-hub-page-contract.md:14-16` |
| Category | `/categories/{slug}` | `src/app/categories/[slug]/page.tsx` |

Do not ship plural `/products/{slug}` as TARGET — `docs/architecture/adr/ADR-010-seo-url-contract.md:64-66`. Canonical, sitemap, breadcrumbs, JSON-LD `@id` must agree (`:69`).

